17
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,160
Clic.

18
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:37,800
Clic.

19
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:38,540
Ecco fatto.

20
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:39,300
Si è acceso.

21
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:40,760
Allora.

22
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:46,880
